 "notes": "Killer KB-Simmony electric bass, direct input (neck pickup, flat onboard EQ, roundwound strings), mezzo-forte layer, fingerstyle-type pluck, 15 notes D1-G#4 every minor third. Dry DI signal: the engine can add gentle compression / cab EQ. Natural decay trimmed to 4 s. Recommended release 0.08-0.15 s (fingers muting the string)."
